OL,3,GNEWSANurse trapped in lift while
OL,4,Atreating baby handed parking fine
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nurse who got stuck in a lift while
OL,7,Ftrying to treat a sick baby is facing a
OL,8,F#266 fine and court action.
OL,10,FCommunity nurse Lisa Smith spent an
OL,11,Fhour and 15 minutes in a block of flats
OL,12,Fin Perry Barr Village, Birmingham, in
OL,13,FNovember while attending to a child in
OL,14,Fa fifth-floor flat.
OL,16,FShe and a colleague had parked in a
OL,17,Fpermit-only bay, which medical staff
OL,18,Fare allowed to do for 30 minutes, but
OL,19,Ffound themselves trapped in a lift for
OL,20,Fmore than 20 minutes before being freed
OL,21,Fby a resident.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
