OL,3,GNEWSANurse trapped in lift while
OL,4,Atreating baby handed parking fine
OL,5,
OL,6,FCivil Enforcement Ltd, which issued the
OL,7,FPenalty Charge Notice (PCN) has been
OL,8,Fcontacted for comment about the fine,
OL,9,Fwhich Smith is fighting.
